<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>OMAKASE – Japanisches Restaurant in Aschaffenburg</title>

<meta name="description" content="OMAKASE Aschaffenburg – Japanisches Restaurant mit Sushi, Sashimi und Omakase. Entdecken Sie japanische Küche in besonderer Atmosphäre.">

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #f5f1e8;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

/* HERO */
.hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.58), rgba(0,0,0,.72)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579871494447-9811cf80d66c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=90")
        center/cover;
}

.hero-content {
    max-width: 900px;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 7px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(60px, 12vw, 130px);
    letter-spacing: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin: 20px 0 40px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 28px;
    border: 1px solid #c8a96b;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 13px;
    transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: #c8a96b;
    color: #111;
}

/* NAV */
nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(10,10,10,.96);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
    padding: 18px;
}

.nav-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.nav-logo {
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

/* SECTIONS */
section {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 100px 25px;
}

.subtitle {
    color: #c8a96b;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 65px);
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.text {
    max-width: 700px;
    color: #c9c5bd;
    font-size: 17px;
}

/* OMakase */
.omakase-box {
    margin-top: 50px;
    border: 1px solid #343434;
    padding: 45px;
    text-align: center;
}

.omakase-box h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 35px;
    font-weight: 400;
}

.price {
    color: #c8a96b;
    margin: 15px 0 25px;
}

/* MENU */
.menu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 50px;
}

.menu-card {
    padding: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid #444;
}

.menu-card h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 27px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.menu-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 9px 0;
    color: #d4d0c8;
}

.menu-item span:last-child {
    color: #c8a96b;
}

/* GALLERY */
.gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 40px;
}

.gallery img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 280px;
    object-fit: cover;
}

/* RESERVATION */
.reservation {
    text-align: center;
    background: #111;
    max-width: none;
}

.reservation-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
}

/* CONTACT */
.contact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
}

.contact-box p {
    margin: 8px 0;
    color: #c9c5bd;
}

.map {
    width: 100%;
    height: 300px;
    border: 0;
}

/* FOOTER */
footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #292929;
    padding: 50px 25px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #aaa;
}

footer .brand {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.footer-links {
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 25px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

/* MOBILE */
@media(max-width: 700px) {

    .nav-links {
        display: none;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: 7px;
    }

    .hero p {
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    section {
        padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .menu-grid,
    .contact {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .gallery img {
        height: 180px;
    }

    .omakase-box {
        padding: 30px 20px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
        <div class="nav-logo">OMAKASE</div>

        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#about">ÜBER UNS</a>
            <a href="#omakase">OMAKASE</a>
            <a href="#menu">SPEISEKARTE</a>
            <a href="#gallery">GALERIE</a>
            <a href="#contact">KONTAKT</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="logo">ASCHAFFENBURG · GERMANY</div>

        <h1>OMAKASE</h1>

        <p>Japanese Dining Experience</p>

        <div class="buttons">
            <a class="btn" href="#menu">SPEISEKARTE</a>
            <a class="btn" href="#reservation">RESERVIEREN</a>
        </div>

    </div>

</header>

<section id="about">

    <div class="subtitle">WILLKOMMEN</div>

    <h2>Japanische Küche.</h2>

    <p class="text">
        Willkommen bei OMAKASE in Aschaffenburg.
        Entdecken Sie hochwertiges Sushi, frische Zutaten
        und japanische Küche in einer modernen Atmosphäre.
        Unser Anspruch ist einfach: Qualität, Frische und
        ein besonderes kulinarisches Erlebnis.
    </p>

</section>

<section id="omakase">

    <div class="subtitle">CHEF'S SELECTION</div>

    <h2>OMAKASE EXPERIENCE</h2>

    <p class="text">
        Lassen Sie sich überraschen.
        Unser Omakase-Erlebnis verbindet japanische Tradition,
        ausgewählte Zutaten und die Kreativität unseres Chefs.
    </p>

    <div class="omakase-box">

        <h3>Omakase Menu</h3>

        <div class="price">
            Preis auf Anfrage
        </div>

        <p>
            Eine besondere Auswahl von Sushi,
            Sashimi und saisonalen Spezialitäten.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="menu">

    <div class="subtitle">OUR MENU</div>

    <h2>Speisekarte</h2>

    <div class="menu-grid">

        <div class="menu-card">

            <h3>Nigiri</h3>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Lachs</span>
                <span>4,50 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Thunfisch</span>
                <span>5,50 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Ebi</span>
                <span>4,90 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Hamachi</span>
                <span>5,90 €</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">

            <h3>Maki</h3>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Avocado Maki</span>
                <span>6,90 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Lachs Maki</span>
                <span>7,90 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Thunfisch Maki</span>
                <span>8,90 €</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">

            <h3>Sashimi</h3>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Lachs Sashimi</span>
                <span>12,90 €</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Thunfisch Sashimi</span>
                <span>15,90 €</span>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">

            <h3>Specials</h3>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Chef's Selection</span>
                <span>auf Anfrage</span>
            </div>

            <div class="menu-item">
                <span>Seasonal Special</span>
                <span>auf Anfrage</span>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="gallery">

    <div class="subtitle">IMPRESSIONS</div>

    <h2>Galerie</h2>

    <div class="gallery">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553621042-f6e147245754?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579871494447-9811cf80d66c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611143669185-af224c5e3252?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563612116625-3012372fccce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540959733332-eab4deabeeaf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579584425555-c3ce17fd4351?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

    </div>

</section>

<section id="reservation" class="reservation">

    <div class="reservation-inner">

        <div class="subtitle">YOUR TABLE</div>

        <h2>Reservieren Sie Ihren Tisch</h2>

        <p class="text" style="margin:auto;">
            Wir freuen uns auf Ihren Besuch.
            Reservieren Sie Ihren Tisch telefonisch.
        </p>

        <br>

        <a class="btn" href="tel:+4960214585897">
            JETZT RESERVIEREN
        </a>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="contact">

    <div class="contact-box">

        <div class="subtitle">BESUCHEN SIE UNS</div>

        <h2>Kontakt</h2>

        <p><strong>OMAKASE</strong></p>

        <p>Am Floßhafen 20</p>

        <p>63739 Aschaffenburg</p>

        <p>Deutschland</p>

        <br>

        <p>☎ +49 6021 4585897</p>

    </div>

    <div>

        <iframe
            class="map"
            src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Am%20Flo%C3%9Fhafen%2020,%2063739%20Aschaffenburg&output=embed"
            loading="lazy">
        </iframe>

    </div>

</section>

<footer>

    <div class="brand">OMAKASE</div>

    <div>
        Japanese Dining · Aschaffenburg
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#">Impressum</a>
        <a href="#">Datenschutz</a>
    </div>

    <br>

    © 2026 OMAKASE

</footer>

</body>
</html>
